# Drop-in: run the T0 gate in ENFORCE for everything this unit launches (the crew's gateways and crew loops).
# The policy's own mode stays shadow, so the owner's interactive CLI only records; a crew run launched by a
# timer or a gateway carried no mode before this and the gate ran in shadow for it.
# Install: copy to ~/.config/systemd/user/<unit>.service.d/krew-tier0.conf for each of
#   hermes-gateway.service, hermes-<profile>-gateway.service, and every unit that starts crew runs,
# then `systemctl --user daemon-reload` and restart the unit in your restart window.
[Service]
Environment=KREW_T0_MODE=enforce
